WEBVTT

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.216
We need to work with the people
in these communities

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:05.096
and give them the resources
and the tools that they need

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.816
to solve their own problems.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.221
That's the best way to do it.

00:13:08.245 --> 00:13:10.536
We shouldn't be doing it from outside.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:14.720
So we need to create this future,
and we need to start doing it now.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.456
Thank you.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:21.736
(Applause)

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:24.252
Chris Anderson: Thank you, incredible.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.520
Stay here.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.256
Tell us -- just while we see
if someone has a question --

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:32.696
just tell us about one of the other things
that you've worked on.